Z||000000||rogergarrison||09-12-2001||01:13 PM||||Newest news on CNN is swat has taken several people into custody that have information in relation to hijackings||||reg||1
Z||000001||Patrick's Dad||09-12-2001||01:18 PM||||Watching it right now on local TV.<P>FBI, Boston SWAT teams and Bomb Squad are in the Wetin hotel in Copley Place. Have been for about 30 minutes. People are walking out of the hotel, and 1000 or more are lined up on the sidewalk, but it is unclear if they were evacuated or are bystanders.<P>Also hearing that there may be/have been arrests in Newton, an affluent suburb northwest of Boston. There was a bomb threat called in to Newton North High. Students were evacuated to the football stadium.||||reg||2
Z||000002||Urchin||09-12-2001||01:19 PM||||I'm wacthing right now that they also have the bomb squad in there.  Probably just taking precautionary measures.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jaygee79||09-12-2001||02:16 PM||||Latest news here is that a few arrests were made but they were not in connection with the hijackings.  had to do with the INS.  there was a report of an injury, but that has yet to be confirmed.  wow this is all practically in my back yard.  i'm not going to Boston for a while, that's for sure.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Patrick's Dad||09-12-2001||02:48 PM||||Just listening to the news:<P>Three people have been taken into custody. The Boston Globe is reporting that credit cards used by these individuals (in three different rooms) allegedly were used to purchase the tickets for the hijackers.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Patrick's Dad||09-12-2001||02:57 PM||||WPRI (Providence) is reporting that three people have been taken off the Amtrak train (which originated in Boston) that was stopped in Providence.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Jaygee79||09-12-2001||04:19 PM||||At least 1 suspect was arrested at Union Station in Providence this afternoon. He was charged with a weapons violation. As of yet they can't confirm that he has anything to do with yesterday's attack. There may be at least one more suspect arrested there on the same charges. This came from a tip from Amtrak.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Urchin||09-12-2001||04:22 PM||||The FBI director just spoke and claimed that there have been absolutely no arrests to this point, but that they do now know the identitiies of the hijackers.||||reg||1
Z||000008||Wolfhound||09-12-2001||05:30 PM||||One news service said that the investigator were using protective custody warrants, hence no arrest is technically correct.||||reg||1
Z||000009||Boomtastic||09-12-2001||06:07 PM||||Being in Boston while it happend, we heard mixed reviews, however the FBI has officially denounced the "arrests" ad nothing more than "detainments".<P>Btw, I'm within eyesight of Logan. I can't say which is spookier - knowing that the hijackers flew right over me on their kamikaze missions, or seeing zero air traffic from a once active airport ..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> There's an eerie calm over the entire city. Police are on most corners, and armed guards patrol almost everything you can think of, from federal courthouses to newspaper buildings.<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||rogergarrison||09-12-2001||10:49 PM||||a couple of guys in fla, apparently housed two of them and gave them flight instructions over the past year. Yes apparently right now, no arrests, just like you said, 'detaining' them to find out information. There was also some search warrants served.||||reg||1
